<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling eases versus dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling eases versus dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling on Tuesday fell against both the dollar and the pound, the central Bank of Tanzania (BoT) said.</p>
<p>The shilling was posted at 596.4453 against the dollar from 595.9800. Against the pound, the shilling was posted at a commercial mean of 960.5782 from 957.7429 previously.</p>
</text>
